<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>轻量进销存 · 求职学习项目</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='bootstrap.min.css') }}">
    <style>
        body { background: #f5f7f9; color: #243444; }
        main { max-width: 1120px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
        nav { background: #243444; padding: 16px; display: flex; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        nav a { color: white; }
        section { background: white; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 1px solid #dce2e7; border-radius: 6px; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; }
        label { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
        input, select, textarea { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 520px; padding: 7px; border: 1px solid #9daab7; border-radius: 4px; }
        input[type=hidden] { display: none; }
        .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
        .table td, .table th { vertical-align: middle; white-space: nowrap; }
        .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .actions form { margin: 0; }
        .hint, footer { color: #586675; font-size: .9rem; }
        .warning { color: #9a4b00; font-weight: bold; }
        footer { margin: 24px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav aria-label="主导航">
    <a href="{{ url_for('inventory') }}">库存查询</a>
    <a href="{{ url_for('products') }}">商品档案</a>
    <a href="{{ url_for('documents') }}">业务单据</a>
    <a href="{{ url_for('ledger') }}">库存流水</a>
</nav>
<main>
    {% for message in get_flashed_messages() %}
    <div class="alert alert-info" role="status">{{ message }}</div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% block content %}{% endblock %}
    <footer>单仓 · 单用户 · 学习演示。基于 <a href="https://github.com/gavindsouza/inventory-management-system">Gavin D'souza 的开源项目</a>二次开发，保留原 MIT 许可证。业务日期单独记录；操作时间显示为北京时间。</footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
